  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759255,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 102 Dalmatians: Puppies to the Rescue (Game Boy Color) - Synopsis\n\nEmbark on a charming platform adventure with Oddball and Domino in *102 Dalmatians: Puppies to the Rescue* for Game Boy Color! When Cruella de Vil’s toy sales plummet, she devises a dastardly plan: reprogram her toys to capture pets and freeze them into \"Super-Gloop\" for a new line of realistic toys. While their parents, Dipstick and Dottie, bravely venture out to rescue their captured puppies, Oddball and Domino are left behind. Determined to save their family, the resourceful pups set off on a quest across London, England, navigating vibrant levels inspired by iconic landmarks like Regent’s Park and Big Ben.\n\nCollect stickers to fill your virtual sticker book, completing tasks like rescuing puppies, finding hidden bones, and solving puzzles.  The game features sharp, clean graphics and creative level design, offering a dazzling experience on the Game Boy Color.  Utilize tumbling and barking to overcome obstacles and enemy toys, and seek guidance from helpful spirit animal friends. Can Oddball and Domino rescue their family and foil Cruella’s scheme?"
    },
